5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if our past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long these projects take and how the rooms are used later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The schedules keep slipping. I want to see why the calendar is always compressed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The costs on paper never match reality. I need to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are doing all the work. I want to check their workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, do you have specific data on usage rates?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Not yet, but I suspect the booking data will show a pattern.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The delivery schedules might explain the delays.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I think the tender records will show the price inflation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,The staffing posts since the freeze are a good place to start.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records and the booking data.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the decade of delivery schedules and the weather days.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the tender records and the renewal reserve.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will examine the staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Agreed. Data first, then judgment.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. Logic over emotion.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready to dig in.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's get to work.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
