35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The post-occupancy reviews are telling. Spaces that anyone could book were rated highest.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"That aligns with my findings. General rooms are always full, specialist ones are idle.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The weather days are a major factor. Six weeks lost to rain on exposed work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Tender records show mechanical lots rising by a fifth. That explains the budget gaps.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Technicians are spending hours on manual checks because the equipment is outdated.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, does the weather data affect all projects equally?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"It seems to impact outdoor work most, but the delays ripple everywhere.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Yes, and projects argued for comfort slip more than those for inspection.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The renewal reserve is missing. We bought AV kit but never planned to replace it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The hiring freeze means grounds staff are unfilled, but technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"So, we should prioritize projects that are widely accessible and less weather-dependent.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. The booking data supports a high-usage, general-purpose space.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need to avoid projects that rely on tight schedules or outdoor work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We must also account for the rising cost of mechanical systems.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,And we need to consider the staff burden. A project that requires less manual upkeep is better.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The survey findings in older blocks are a red flag. Hazardous materials add months.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,That makes older block conversions risky.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. We should avoid those areas.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,The cost of remediation would blow the budget.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,And it would tie up the technicians for even longer.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
