60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate A, the Central Study Commons, fits the high-usage, general-purpose criteria.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is indoors, so weather is less of an issue. And it is widely bookable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The schedule risk is lower than for outdoor or complex mechanical projects.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"The cost is manageable, and there is no major mechanical plant to inflate the price.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,It requires minimal manual upkeep compared to the lab ventilation upgrade.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate B, the Media Center, has low usage outside specific weeks.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,The booking data confirms it. Specialist rooms are idle most of the time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It also involves complex AV systems, which we know are not budgeted for renewal.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"The tender records show AV costs are rising, and we have no reserve for them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It would add to the technicians' workload for maintenance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate C, the Path Network, is heavily weather-dependent.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,The site diaries show six weeks lost to rain. That is a huge schedule risk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"And it is an outdoor project, so the delays are inevitable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"The surfacing costs are stable, but the schedule slip is a problem.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"It would require grounds staff, which are currently unfilled.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate D, the Lab Ventilation, is in older blocks with hazardous materials.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,The survey findings show months of delay before work can even start.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"And it is a complex mechanical project, so the cost is rising.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Kenji,,The tender records show mechanical lots up by a fifth. That is a budget risk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,It would require the most manual upkeep from the technicians.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
